# .claudeignore — A4 (Anthropic 大型代码库最佳实践) Phase M0 skeleton.
#
# Excludes noise from Claude Code's repo scan + speeds up grep / Glob.
# Claude Code CAN still explicitly read these paths via Read tool (this file only
# affects implicit scan / auto-attach behavior).
#
# Quarterly review per policies/documentation.md + policies/ci-gates.md §Review Cadence.
#
# CRITICAL: The following 4 paths are explicitly NOT excluded (R-G22 mitigation):
#   - src/mj_agent/biz_catalog/   (biz-catalog-sync 4 项专属必停)
#   - src/mj_agent/tools/sql/     (sql-guardrail-relax 4 项专属必停)
#   - src/mj_agent/prompts/       (prompt-version-bump 4 项专属必停)
#   - src/mj_agent/skills/        (runtime-skill-content-change 4 项专属必停)

# Python environments / caches
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Build artifacts
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# Dependency lock files (lockfiles are noise; pyproject.toml is enough for context)
uv.lock

# Git internals
.git/

# Node (if ever added)
node_modules/

# Archive — default hidden (per policies/archive.md §3 ai_visibility);
# Claude Code MUST explicitly check archive.yml ai_visibility before reading
# any path under archive/.
archive/

# Large baselines (mcp wrapper script baseline files etc.)
docs/_baselines/

# Docker runtime logs
docker/**/*.log

# OS / IDE noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# === DO NOT add the following to this file (R-G22 mitigation) ===
# src/mj_agent/biz_catalog/
# src/mj_agent/tools/sql/
# src/mj_agent/prompts/
# src/mj_agent/skills/

# Generated projection artifacts (dual-agent-compat v5 S0/S2; D-012 — generator-owned,
# committed but never hand-edited; F9 emergency switch = clear projections + regenerate).
# Skill discovery is unaffected; byte-identical projection is the real dual-discovery guard.
# .codex/ holds the generated Codex MCP config (emitter B, S2 #330) — same family.
.agents/
.codex/
